{
  "kind": "versionGroups",
  "comment": "Phase 1196. Which version line each packable project ships on. Membership is by repo-relative project-file glob ('*' within one path segment, '**' across segments); every packable project matches exactly one group (SdkManifestTests). The single lockstep group is the core: its version IS <Version> in Directory.Build.props, the number the release tag names. Every other group is a companion family on its own line. Edit a version or a glob here, then run the GenerateSdkManifest target: it rewrites the generated regions of Directory.Build.props and src/ToolUp.Sdk/build/ToolUp.Sdk.props. Model and rulings: docs/platform/release-process.md.",
